OL,3,GNEWSAThunderstorm warning issued by the
OL,4,AMet Office
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office has issued a yellow
OL,7,Fwarning for thunderstorms across parts
OL,8,Fof the East of England.
OL,10,FIt will be in place between 12:00 BST
OL,11,Fand 21:00 on Saturday in Bedfordshire,
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, Norfolk, Suffolk and
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire.
OL,15,F"An area of heavy showers and
OL,16,Fthunderstorms will move across this
OL,17,Fregion during the afternoon and early
OL,18,Fevening," the Met Office said.
OL,20,FIt also warned there would "probably"
OL,21,Fbe damage to buildings and some
OL,22,Fflooding.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
